ining-map entry still has `\\\\\\\\notready`, although every linked definition, evaluation identity, membership theorem, degree bound, and line specification is complete at this head; replace it with statement-level `\\\\\\\\leanok`.  <!-- lane=prose -->\\\\n<!-- findings:end -->\\\\n\\\\n## Code review\\\\n\\\\nReviewed the complete base-to-head code diff against the QPBT paper and blueprint. The native-point result is correctly documented as a supplied-witness interface theorem on the original carriers, not as the source construction theorem. The affine data-processing argument and exact constants are sound. Target declarations use only standard axioms.\\\\n\\\\nReused the exact-head nine-context green CI receipt and ran focused workflow and sampler tests. The worktree remains clean at the required head. The external `lean-conventions` skill was unavailable; checked-in conventions and the canonical prompt were used.\\\\n\\\\nNative review binding: 15fd4bae67784f81827add5240aab2c0 e90a2a689fef401652e20d5fd1de819ec293337a 76323185c2bfde8363293c9dc5a42c26e1405cd64ae751400bcf8f5056c475df\\\\n\\\\n## Prose review\\\\n\\\\nThe new point-measurement equality is correctly scoped as a Lean-only auxiliary. It remains on `setting.ExpandedLocalSpace side`, uses the singleton coordinate from `P.extendedDirectLd.k = 1`, and identifies the direct-game point answer with precisely the affine coarse-graining of the supplied joint measurement. It introduces no quantitative bound or claim that the supplied witnesses have been constructed.\\\\n\\\\nThe citation to paper lines 1277\\\\u20131289 is appropriately described as source context rather than as the statement being formalized. Accordingly, `lem:qld-4-7` should remain `\\\\\\\\notready`, and the new auxiliary should not be used to add `\\\\\\\\leanok` to that source-labelled lemma. I did not treat unmerged source-domain or complex-overlap work as completing it.\\\\n\\\\nThe Chapter 12 expectation-notation replacements are consistent and preserve the linked statements. The external `lean-conventions` skill was unavailable; this review applied the checked-in `AGENTS.md`, `docs/mathematical_language.md`, and `docs/blueprint_style_guide.md`.\\\\n\\\\nNative review binding: da2e029a8bca4483bab193c553b2d602 e90a2a689fef401652e20d5fd1de819ec293337a b8e395742f9310360d0c592b5c27e55e7085d35cac165a8abb2e0ac7cea78fca\\\\n\\\",\\n  \\\"state\\\": \\\"COMMENTED\\\",\\n  \\\"html_url\\\": \\\"https://github.com/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pull/363#pullrequestreview-5146843541\\\",\\n  \\\"pull_request_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/363\\\",\\n  \\\"author_association\\\": \\\"OWNER\\\",\\n  \\\"_links\\\": {\\n   \\\"html\\\": {\\n    \\\"href\\\": \\\"https://github.com/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pull/363#pullrequestreview-5146843541\\\"\\n   },\\n   \\\"pull_request\\\": {\\n    \\\"href\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/363\\\"\\n   }\\n  },\\n  \\\"submitted_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-08T20:46:53Z\\\",\\n  \\\"commit_id\\\": \\\"e90a2a689fef401652e20d5fd1de819ec293337a\\\"\\n }\\n]\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n{\"type\":\"item.started\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_15\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/bash -lc '/home/drx/MIPStarRE-qpbt/local/bin/gh_common.py issue-view 362'\",\"aggregated_output\":\"\",\"exit_code\":null,\"status\":\"in_progress\"}}\n{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_15\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/bash -lc '/home/drx/MIPStarRE-qpbt/local/bin/gh_common.py issue-view 362'\",\"aggregated_output\":\"{\\n \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/issues/362\\\",\\n \\\"repository_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A\\\",\\n \\\"labels_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/issues/362/labels{/name}\\\",\\n \\\"comments_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/issu