\\\nsoundness result to scalar polynomial marginals and retain its three existing\\\\n`deltaLd` bounds by `consistencyDefect_postprocess_le` and the existing\\\\n`directPolyMeasTuple_evaluation_marginal` theorem.\\\\n\\\\n## Source and Existing API\\\\n\\\\n- `references/qpbt-paper/14_analysis_of_the_pauli_basis_test.tex:1277-1289`.\\\\n- Blueprint `lem:qld-4-7`.\\\\n- Published PR #361 head `e359144058ca4245614ab5697d8a62589f62a860`.\\\\n- `ExtendedLineGame.answerMeasurement`, `directLdPointQuestionOf`,\\\\n  `directLdPointValuesOrZero`, `CombinedPointsWitness.extendedQ`,\\\\n  `Measurement.postprocess_comp`, and\\\\n  `directPolyMeasTuple_evaluation_marginal`.\\\\n- Parent issue #119 and prerequisite issue #360.\\\\n\\\\n## Completion Boundary\\\\n\\\\nAdd a narrow Lean-only successor module and root re-export.  The required\\\\npublic theorem is `point_values_measurement_eq_suppliedQ` with the exact\\\\nmeasurement equality described above.  Do not add a probability, support,\\\\nprojectivity, global-pair, compressed-space, producer, good-polynomial-shape,\\\\nor passing-value premise.  Do not duplicate polynomial evaluation naturality.\\\\nThis auxiliary interface does not complete paper `lem:qld-4-7`.\\\\n\\\\n## Validation\\\\n\\\\n- First type-check the focused module.\\\\n- Scan changed Lean files for proof holes and kernel bypasses.\\\\n- Check public declarations use only standard Lean axioms.\\\\n- Run installed hooks and publish through the checked stacked-PR path.\\\\n- Canonical CI, review, and final integration remain independently owned.\\\",\\n \\\"closed_by\\\": null,\\n \\\"reactions\\\": {\\n  \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/issues/362/reactions\\\",\\n  \\\"total_count\\\": 0,\\n  \\\"+1\\\": 0,\\n  \\\"-1\\\": 0,\\n  \\\"laugh\\\": 0,\\n  \\\"hooray\\\": 0,\\n  \\\"confused\\\": 0,\\n  \\\"heart\\\": 0,\\n  \\\"rocket\\\": 0,\\n  \\\"eyes\\\": 0\\n },\\n \\\"timeline_url\\\": \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/